{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laburantitos</strong> is a time management tool that combines the functionality of the Pomodoro system and the customization of a Virtual Pet-like character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its goal is to assist home-office workers in their daily work by better managing their time and taking breaks to relax and unwind, thereby improving productivity and workday management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Configure it to your liking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It works with work-rest cycles, where you can select the number of cycles to perform and the duration of each segment. You can also indicate whether you're working during the day or at night, impacting the sky in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And as a standout customization feature, you can personalize your companion, allowing you to choose their work style, expression, and outfit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683250?t=1745330920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683250/025fbdda6787be1f0b8db24bff9b858b308f9d24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745330920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683250/5e14f0247004fe0f3b42e30d02718ab3798e3449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745330920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683250/5e14f0247004fe0f3b42e30d02718ab3798e3449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745330920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laburantitos</strong> is a time management tool that combines the functionality of the Pomodoro system and the customization of a Virtual Pet-like character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its goal is to assist home-office workers in their daily work by better managing their time and taking breaks to relax and unwind, thereby improving productivity and workday management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Configure it to your liking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It works with work-rest cycles, where you can select the number of cycles to perform and the duration of each segment. You can also indicate whether you're working during the day or at night, impacting the sky in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And as a standout customization feature, you can personalize your companion, allowing you to choose their work style, expression, and outfit.</p>","developers":["Los Pibes del Sur"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683250/24e6c48e1225c4589ffa1f124b354b02e6740b27/header.jpg?t=1745330920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128221,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128221/movie480.mp4?t=1745330918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128221/movie_max.mp4?t=1745330918"},"name":"Trailer Steam","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128221/2927b23ee6ca1d938235faf840a10a53b75fb93c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745330918","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128221/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745330918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128221/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745330918"}}],"name":"Laburantitos","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr